index 0000000..5bbe8e9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/retrying-enabled-false-iterator-3f9a1c2e7b4d8a60.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    ``enabled=False`` is now honoured by the iterator pattern. ``for attempt in
+    Retrying(enabled=False)`` and ``async for attempt in AsyncRetrying(enabled=False)``
+    run the body exactly once and let any exception propagate unchanged, instead of
+    retrying and raising ``RetryError``. This matches the decorator path.
